    .desc = { ent-BaseCartridge.desc }
ent-CartridgeCaselessRifle = 彈匣（.25 無殼彈） | cartridge (.25 caseless)
    .desc = 一種採用無彈殼技術的小口徑彈藥，捨棄傳統黃銅彈殼，改用硬化推進劑。標準動能彈藥在大多數情況下都很常見且實用。 | A small caliber utilizing caseless technology, omitting conventional brass casing in favor of hardened propellant. Standard kinetic ammunition is common and useful in most situations.
ent-CartridgeCaselessRiflePractice = 子彈（.25 無殼練習彈） | cartridge (.25 caseless practice)
    .desc = 這是一種採用無殼技術的小口徑彈藥，捨棄傳統的黃銅彈殼，改用硬化推進劑。練習彈會射出一顆石膏彈頭，雖然會帶來些許刺痛感，但除此之外並不會造成任何持久性傷害。 | A small caliber utilizing caseless technology, omitting conventional brass casing in favor of hardened propellant. Practice ammunition fires a chalk projectile that stings a little, but otherwise causes no lasting damage.
